    "Diagnostic only, not a strength-selection experiment. Preserve both frozen source artifacts. New local physical counter with reset-hand-counter; mature cohort keeps its optimizer state but is a new experiment, not a continuation of the completed historical record. Exact source reference remains Standard10. No frozen evaluation required to interpret component gradients, and no Slumbot requested. Any following treatment must be separately preregistered.",
