    "Audit now obeys physical target precedence and verifies checkpoint physical target against preregistration. Source audit PASS. Added wrapper mature-only recovery mode; source output will not be touched. Trainer unchanged from initial execution snapshot. Corrected auditor and wrapper captured in a separate pre-mature snapshot.",
